      "agent_input": "Hi, I\u2019d like to exchange the Everyday Crew Tee I received from order #W4669380. The item delivered was 0924077030 in Black, size S, and I\u2019d like to switch it for item 3301828484 in Black, size M. My account email is jordan.lee1989@example.com. If there\u2019s a price difference, please use gift card_5581027. Let me know if you need any more information to process this exchange.",
