        "response": "[Awaiting tool approval]\n\n**Policy:** Shell command approval (skills demo)\nAbout to run a shell command in the agent workspace. Approve to continue?\n**Required Tools:** run_command\n```python\nskill_info = await load_skill(\"tau2Retail\")\nprint(skill_info)\n\nfiles = await list_files(\".\")\nprint(files)\n\nskills_files = await list_files(\"./skills/tau2Retail\")\nprint(skills_files)\n\nutils_content = await read_file(\"./skills/tau2Retail/utils.py\")\nprint(utils_content)\n\nskill_md = await read_file(\"./skills/tau2Retail/SKILL.md\")\nprint(skill_md)\n\nsetup_result = await run_command(\"cd skills/tau2Retail && ls -la\")\nprint(setup_result)\n\n# Try importing the utils module properly via a Python script\nimport_test = await run_command(\"cd skills/tau2Retail && python -c \\\"import utils; print(dir(utils))\\\"\")\nprint(import_test)\n\nscript = \"\"\"\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, 'skills/tau2Retail')\nimport utils\n\n# Step 1: Get user details\nuser = utils.get_user_details(email=\"jordan.lee1989@example.com\")\nprint(\"USER:\", user)\n\n# Step 2: Get order details\norder = utils.get_order_details(order_id=\"#W4669380\")\nprint(\"ORDER:\", order)\n\n# Step 3: Get current product details\ncurrent_product = utils.get_product_details(product_id=\"0924077030\")\nprint(\"CURRENT_PRODUCT:\", current_product)\n\n# Step 4: Get new product details\nnew_product = utils.get_product_details(product_id=\"3301828484\")\nprint(\"NEW_PRODUCT:\", new_product)\n\"\"\"\nawait write_file(\"./exchange_lookup.py\", script)\nprint(\"Script written\")\n\nlookup_result = await run_command(\"python ./exchange_lookup.py\")\nprint(lookup_result)\n```",
